":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-02T20:56:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T14:33:58Z","closed_at":"2025-08-14T14:33:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproduced in Godot 4.5.beta2\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Vulkan 1.3.271 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter upgrading my project to 4.5 i noticed `Resource.duplicate(true)` was not working as before. I already expected this, but turns out none of the 3 option worked as i expected, and in particular `DEEP_DUPLICATE_ALL` (the one i need according to documentation) caused this assert because duplicating a `PackedScene` seems to attempt to create a duplicate of the Script, which is usually impossible because of the `PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE` flag\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new resource script like the following:\n```\nclass_name MyResource extends Resource\n@export var my_scene: PackedScene\n```\n- Create a scene script like the following:\n```\nclass_name MyScene extends Node\n```\n- Create a new scene, assign the **MyScene** script and save it\n- Create a new MyResource, assign the just created scene to the my_scene proeprty in the inspector and save it\n- In the main scene of the project run the following code:\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tpreload(\"res://my_resource.tres\").duplicate_deep(Resource.DEEP_DUPLICATE_ALL)\n```\n\n**Expected result**\n- deep duplicate works, script is not duplicated\n\n**Actual Result**\n- The following error prompts\n```\nParser Error: Class \"MyScene\" hides a global script class.\n```\n\nMy understanding is the Script subresource of PackedScene is being duplicated and because of that is errors because of the repeated class_name\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21025246/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108220/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108220/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}